  "body": "Your Coastal Lifestyle Awaits!\r\nWelcome to the opportunity of a lifetime! This 1012sqm vacant section in Stanmore Bay is your chance to design a coastal haven that captures the essence of seaside living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nSunny North-Facing Aspect with Sea Views: Picture your mornings with breathtaking sea views, just like your neighbour's kitchen and north-facing deck, making meal preparation a daily pleasure.\r\n\r\nBlank Canvas for Your Vision: With no existing dwelling, the possibilities are endless. Enjoy natural light all day, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere throughout your future home.\r\n\r\nAmple Parking Space: Forget parking worries, you will have plenty of space for your boats, cars, or campervans.\r\n\r\nConveniently Located: Walk to local schools, beaches, shops, and sporting facilities. Minutes away from the upcoming O Mahurangi Penlink access.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the chance to turn this blank canvas into your dream coastal home. Contact us now to secure this exclusive section in Stanmore Bay.",
